  <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
    <name>GroupWarehouseManagement</name>
    <id>1281</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
      <name>AGroupOfSeveralWarehousesWarehousesOrder</name>
      <id>3206</id>
      <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
        <name>GroupUseMultipleWarehouses</name>
        <id>2890</id>
        <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
          <name>UseSeveralWarehouses</name>
          <id>2891</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Multiple warehouses</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>چند انبار</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Più magazzini</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Kilka magazynów</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Несколько складов</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Birden fazla ambar</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Nhiều kho</value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
            <segments>ConstantsSet.UseSeveralWarehouses</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
          <handlers>
            <event>OnChange</event>
            <name>UseSeveralWarehousesOnChange</name>
          </handlers>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>UseSeveralWarehousesExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>3014</id>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
          <contextMenu>
            <name>UseSeveralWarehousesContextMenu</name>
            <id>2892</id>
            <autoFill>true</autoFill>
          </contextMenu>
          <type>CheckBoxField</type>
          <warningOnEditRepresentation>Show</warningOnEditRepresentation>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>It is not recommended that you disable usage of several warehouses after you start working with the system</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>توصیه نمی‌شود پس از شروع کار با سیستم، استفاده از چند انبار را غیرفعال کنید</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Non è consigliabile disattivare la possibilità d'uso di alcuni magazzini dopo l'avvio del sistema</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Nie zaleca się wyłączania możliwości używania kilku magazynów po rozpoczęciu pracy z systemem</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Отключать возможность использования нескольких складов после начала работы с системой не рекомендуется</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Sistemle işe başladıktan sonra birden fazla ambar kullanma imkanının devre dışı bırakılması önerilmemektedir.</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Không nên ngắt sử dụng nhiều kho sau khi bắt đầu làm việc với hệ thống</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <editMode>Enter</editMode>
          <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
          <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
          <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
        </items>
        <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
          <name>TheWarehousesPageGroup</name>
          <id>2895</id>
          <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
            <name>GroupExplanationMultipleWarehouses</name>
            <id>2896</id>
            <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
              <name>ExplanationSeveralWarehouses</name>
              <id>2898</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>Select this option if you want to create more than one warehouse. To enable the option, go to &quot;Master data and settings&quot; — &quot;Warehouses and stores&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>اگر می‌خواهید بیش از یک انبار ایجاد کنید این گزینه را انتخاب کنید. برای فعال‌سازی گزینه، به &quot;داده‌های پایه و تنظیمات&quot; — &quot;انبارها و فروشگاه‌ها&quot; بروید.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>Possibilità di lavorare con più magazzini. Per la configurazione, è necessario andare alla sezione &quot;Informazioni sulle normative, riferimento e amministrazione&quot;, &quot;Magazzini e negozi&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>Możliwość pracy z kilkoma magazynami. Aby skonfigurować należy przejść do rozdziału &quot;Ustawienia&quot; - &quot;Magazyny i sklepy&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Возможность работы с несколькими складами. Для настройки необходимо перейти в раздел &quot;НСИ и администрирование&quot; — &quot;Склады и магазины&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Birden fazla ambar ile çalışabilme. Ayarlamak için &quot;Master veri ve yönetim&quot; - &quot;Ambarlar ve mağazalar&quot; bölümüne git.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Tính năng làm việc với nhiều kho bãi. Để tùy chỉnh, hãy chuyển đến phân hệ &quot;Danh mục và quản trị&quot; - &quot;Kho bãi và cửa hàng&quot;.</value>
              </title>
              <visible>true</visible>
              <enabled>true</enabled>
              <userVisible>
                <common>true</common>
              </userVisible>
              <extendedTooltip>
                <name>ExplanationSeveralWarehousesExtendedTooltip</name>
                <id>3017</id>
                <type>Label</type>
                <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
                <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
                <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                  <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
                </extInfo>
              </extendedTooltip>
              <contextMenu>
                <name>ExplanationSeveralWarehousesContextMenu</name>
                <id>2899</id>
                <autoFill>true</autoFill>
              </contextMenu>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <maxWidth>40</maxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <horizontalStretch>true</horizontalStretch>
              <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
                <color>Style.NoteText</color>
              </textColor>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
                <verticalAlign>Top</verticalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </items>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Explanation several warehouses</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>توضیح چند انبار</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Spiegazione di più magazzini</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Komentarz kilka magazynów</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Пояснение несколько складов</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Not birden fazla ambar</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Giải thích về một số kho</value>
            </title>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>GroupExplanationMultipleWarehousesExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>3016</id>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <type>Page</type>
