              <name>UseDeliveryManagementContextMenu</name>
              <id>3380</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
            <type>CheckBoxField</type>
            <warningOnEditRepresentation>Show</warningOnEditRepresentation>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>It is not recommended that you disable delivery management after you start working with the system</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>توصیه نمی‌شود پس از شروع کار با سیستم، مدیریت تحویل را غیرفعال کنید</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Отключать возможность управления доставкой после начала работы с системой не рекомендуется</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Sistem kullanılmaya başlandıktan sonra teslimat yönetimi işlevini devre dışı bırakmanız önerilmez</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Không nên tắt khả năng quản lý giao nhận sau khi bắt đầu làm việc với hệ thống</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>It is not recommended that you disable delivery management after you start working with the system</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>It is not recommended that you disable delivery management after you start working with the system</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <editMode>Enter</editMode>
            <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
            <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
            <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
