          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>OptionOfOrderingNeedsByPriorityAndDateOfShipmentOfOrder</name>
            <id>3667</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Option of sorting demands by priority and order shipment date</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>گزینه مرتب‌سازی تقاضاها بر اساس اولویت و تاریخ ارسال سفارش</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Вариант упорядочивания потребностей по приоритету и дате отгрузки заказа</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Talepleri önceliğe ve sevkiyat tarihine göre sıralama seçeneği</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Phương án trình tự yêu cầu theo ưu tiên và ngày giao hàng của đơn hàng</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Option of sorting demands by priority and order shipment date</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Option of sorting demands by priority and order shipment date</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>ConstantsSet.OptionOfOrderingDemandsByOrdersForSupply</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
            <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>OptionOfOrderingNeedsByPriorityAndDateOfShipmentOfOrderOnChange</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>OptionOfOrderingNeedsByPriorityAndDateOfShipmentOfOrderExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>3669</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>First come orders with a high priority, then orders with a lower priority.
If the priority is the same, first come orders with an earlier shipment date,
then orders with a later shipment date</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>ابتدا سفارش‌های با اولویت بالا، سپس سفارش‌های با اولویت پایین‌تر.
در صورت یکسان بودن اولویت، ابتدا سفارش‌های با تاریخ ارسال زودتر،
سپس سفارش‌های با تاریخ ارسال دیرتر</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Сначала заказы с высоким приоритетом, затем с меньшим приоритетом.
При равном приоритете – сначала заказы с меньшей датой отгрузки,
затем с большей датой отгрузки</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Önce yüksek önceliğe sahip siparişler, sonra daha düşük önceliğe sahip siparişler.
Eşit öncelik durumunda: önce sevkiyat tarihi daha düşük olan siparişler,
sonra sevkiyat tarihi daha yüksek olan siparişler</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Ban đầu, đơn hàng với ưu tiên cao, sau đó với ưu tiên thấp.
Với ưu tiên bằng nhau - ban đầu, đơn hàng với ngày giao hàng nhỏ,
sau đó với ngày giao hàng lớn</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>First come orders with a high priority, then orders with a lower priority.
If the priority is the same, first come orders with an earlier shipment date,
then orders with a later shipment date</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>First come orders with a high priority, then orders with a lower priority.
If the priority is the same, first come orders with an earlier shipment date,
then orders with a later shipment date</value>
              </title>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
