      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>ControlBalanceOfGoodsToBeReservedUponReceipt</name>
        <id>3690</id>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
          <segments>ConstantsSet.ControlBalanceOfGoodsToBeReservedUponReceipt</segments>
        </dataPath>
        <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
        <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
        <handlers>
          <event>OnChange</event>
          <name>ControlBalanceOfGoodsToBeReservedUponReceiptOnChange</name>
        </handlers>
        <extendedTooltip>
          <name>ControlBalanceOfGoodsToBeReservedUponReceiptExtendedTooltip</name>
          <id>3709</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>When entering an order with the &quot;Reserve upon receipt&quot; action, the system will check that the expected goods receipt to the warehouse is already planned by the corresponding order, or the goods were delivered to the warehouse. The check is also performed when trying to ship goods from the warehouse</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>هنگام ورود سفارش با اقدام &quot;رزرو هنگام دریافت&quot;، سیستم بررسی می‌کند که دریافت مورد انتظار کالا به انبار قبلاً با سفارش مربوطه برنامه‌ریزی شده یا کالا به انبار تحویل شده است. این بررسی هنگام تلاش برای ارسال کالا از انبار نیز انجام می‌شود</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>При вводе заказа с действием &quot;Резервировать по мере поступления&quot; будет выполнен контроль, что ожидаемое поступление товаров на склад уже запланировано соответствующим заказом, или товар уже поступил на склад. Контроль срабатывает также при попытке отгрузить товары со склада</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>&quot;Geldikçe rezerve et&quot; eylemiyle sipariş girerken, ürünlerin ambara beklenen girişinin ilgili sipariş tarafından zaten planlanmış olup olmadığı veya ürünlerin ambara zaten alınmış olup olmadığı kontrol edilir. Kontrol ayrıca ambardan ürün sevkiyatı yapılmaya çalışıldığında da çalışır</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Khi nhập đơn hàng với thao tác &quot;Dự phòng theo mức tiếp nhận&quot; sẽ thực hiện kiểm soát, đã dự tính tiếp nhận hàng hóa vào kho theo kế hoạch bởi đơn hàng tương ứng, hoặc đã tiếp nhận hàng hóa vào kho. Ngoài ra, kích hoạt việc kiểm soát khi thử giao hàng hóa từ kho</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>When entering an order with the &quot;Reserve upon receipt&quot; action, the system will check that the expected goods receipt to the warehouse is already planned by the corresponding order, or the goods were delivered to the warehouse. The check is also performed when trying to ship goods from the warehouse</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>When entering an order with the &quot;Reserve upon receipt&quot; action, the system will check that the expected goods receipt to the warehouse is already planned by the corresponding order, or the goods were delivered to the warehouse. The check is also performed when trying to ship goods from the warehouse</value>
          </title>
          <type>Label</type>
          <maxWidth>75</maxWidth>
          <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
            <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
          </extInfo>
        </extendedTooltip>
        <contextMenu>
          <name>ControlBalanceOfGoodsToBeReservedUponReceiptContextMenu</name>
          <id>3691</id>
          <autoFill>true</autoFill>
        </contextMenu>
        <type>CheckBoxField</type>
        <editMode>Enter</editMode>
        <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
        <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
        <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
      </items>
